#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Modules/ConfigOptions.lua:173 label-field
msgid "Controls how ^xE05030Life ^7regeneration is calculated:\n	Minimum: does not include burst regen\n	Average: includes burst regen, averaged based on uptime\n	Burst: includes full burst regen"
msgstr "控制^xE05030生命^7再生的計算方式：\n	Minimum：不包含突發再生\n	Average：包含突發再生，按上線時間平均\n	Burst：包含完整突發再生"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Modules/ConfigOptions.lua:196 label-field
msgid "Controls how ancestrally boosted attacks are calculated:\nAverage: Averages out Boost usage with cast time, attack speed and cooldown.\nMax Hit: Shows maximum hit for lining up all sources of ancestral boost."
msgstr "控制祖先強化攻擊的計算方式：\nAverage：以施放時間、攻擊速度與冷卻時間平均化 Boost 使用。\nMax Hit：顯示對齊全部祖先加成來源時的最高命中。"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Modules/ConfigOptions.lua:189 label-field
msgid "Controls how Defending with Double Armour is calculated:\n	Minimum: never Defend with Double Armour\n	Average: Damage Reduction from Defending with Double Armour is proportional to chance\n	Maximum: always Defend with Double Armour\nThis setting has no effect if you have 100% chance to Defend with Double Armour."
msgstr "控制「雙重護甲防禦」如何計算：\n	Minimum：永不以雙重護甲防禦\n	Average：雙重護甲防禦的傷害減免與機率成比例\n	Maximum：總是以雙重護甲防禦\n若你有100%機率以雙重護甲防禦，本設定無效。"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Modules/ConfigOptions.lua:170 label-field
msgid "Controls how the base damage for applying Ailments is calculated:\n	Average: damage is based on the average application, including both crits and non-crits\n	Crits Only: damage is based solely on Ailments inflicted with crits"
msgstr "控制如何計算施加異常狀態的基礎傷害：\n	Average：傷害依照平均施加值計算，包含暴擊與非暴擊\n	Crits Only：傷害僅依據暴擊造成的異常狀態"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Modules/ConfigOptions.lua:863 label-field
msgid "Controls how the chance on hit to ignore enemy physical damage reduction is calculated:\n	Minimum: never ignores unless chance is at least 100%\n	Average: damage is based on the average application\n	Max Effect: always ignores if you have any chance"
msgstr "控制命中時忽略敵方物理傷害減免機率如何計算：\n	Minimum：除非機率至少達100%，否則永不忽略\n	Average：傷害依照平均應用值計算\n	Max Effect：只要有機率便始終忽略"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Modules/ConfigOptions.lua:171 label-field
msgid "Controls how the cooldown for skills is calculated:\n	Base: The cooldown is calculated with normal behavior.\n	Average: The cooldown is adjusted to reflect the average time between uses, factoring in effects such as a chance to not consume a cooldown."
msgstr "控制技能冷卻時間如何計算：\n	Base：冷卻時間以一般行為計算。\n	Average：冷卻時間會依兩次使用間的平均時間調整，並考慮例如「有機率不消耗冷卻」等效果。"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Modules/ConfigOptions.lua:2254 label-field
msgid "Controls which types of damage the EHP calculation uses:\n	Average: uses the Average of all typed damage types (except Damage Over Time and Untyped)\n\nIf a specific damage type is selected, that will be the only type used."
msgstr "控制 EHP 計算使用哪些傷害類型：\n	Average：使用所有已類型化傷害的平均值（不含持續傷害與未分類傷害）\n\n若選取特定傷害類型，將僅使用該類型。"

