#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Classes/TradeQuery.lua:320 tooltip-text
msgid "The Trader feature supports two modes of operation depending on the authorization availability.\nYou can click this button to authorize PoB by logging in.\n\n^2Session Mode^7\n- Requires authorization on pathofexile.com.\n- You can search, compare, and quickly import items without leaving Path of Building.\n- You can select an item and search it directly.\n- You can generate and perform searches for the private leagues you are participating.\n\n^xFF9922No Session Mode^7\n- Doesn't require authorization.\n- You cannot search and compare items in Path of Building.\n- You can generate weighted search URLs but have to visit the trade site and manually import items.\n- You can only generate weighted searches for public leagues. (Generated searches can be modified\non trade site to work on other leagues and realms)"
msgstr "Trader 功能會依授權狀態提供兩種操作模式。\n你可以點擊此按鈕登入並授權 PoB。\n\n^2Session 模式^7\n- 需要在 pathofexile.com 完成授權。\n- 你可以在 Path of Building 內搜尋、比較並快速匯入物品。\n- 你可以選取物品並直接搜尋。\n- 你可以為自己參與的私人聯盟產生並執行搜尋。\n\n^xFF9922無 Session 模式^7\n- 不需要授權。\n- 你無法在 Path of Building 內搜尋和比較物品。\n- 你可以產生加權搜尋 URL，但必須前往交易網站並手動匯入物品。\n- 你只能為公開聯盟產生加權搜尋。產生的搜尋可在交易網站上修改，\n以支援其他聯盟和 realm。"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Classes/TradeQuery.lua:410 tooltip-text
msgid "Weighted Sum searches will always sort using descending weighted sum\nAdditional post filtering options can be done these include:\nHighest Stat Value - Sort from highest to lowest Stat Value change of equipping item\nHighest Stat Value / Price - Sorts from highest to lowest by estimated Stat Value per currency\nLowest Price - Sorts from lowest to highest price of retrieved items\nHighest Weight - Displays the order retrieved from trade"
msgstr "加權總和搜尋一律依加權總和由高到低排序\n也可以再套用下列後置篩選選項:\n最高屬性值 - 依裝備物品後的屬性值變化由高到低排序\n最高屬性值 / 價格 - 依每單位通貨的估計屬性值由高到低排序\n最低價格 - 依擷取物品的價格由低到高排序\n最高權重 - 顯示交易回傳的順序"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Classes/TradeQuery.lua:1040 tooltip-text
msgid "Creates a weighted search to find the highest Stat Value items for this slot.\nNote that even if you are authenticated, you can click this button again to show the search link.\nIf you have additional requirements that the trade tool doesn't cover (e.g. Adorned Magic jewels),\nyou can add them, copy the link here, and press \"Price Item\" to evaluate the items."
msgstr "建立加權搜尋，尋找此欄位中屬性值最高的物品。\n請注意，即使你已授權，也可以再次點擊此按鈕來顯示搜尋連結。\n如果你有交易工具未涵蓋的額外需求，例如 Adorned 魔法珠寶，\n可以自行加入條件，將連結複製到這裡，再按「估價物品」評估物品。"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Classes/TradeQueryGenerator.lua:1001 tooltip-text
msgid "Controls how augments are used in the search.\n\nCopy Current: augments in weights are skipped and augments are replaced with the current augments when possible.\nUsually the best opinion as this ensures the augments makes sense for your build.\n\nKeep: augments will be included in weights and will not be changed on items.\nBest used when you value an augment greatly, and cannot add it yourself.\n\nRemove: augments are completely ignored, and removed from items."
msgstr "控制搜尋中如何使用增幅。\n\n複製目前: 權重中的增幅會被略過，並在可能時以目前增幅替換。\n這通常是最佳選項，因為可確保增幅適合你的構築。\n\n保留: 增幅會納入權重，且不會變更物品上的增幅。\n當你很重視某個增幅且無法自行加入時最適合使用。\n\n移除: 完全忽略增幅，並從物品上移除。"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Classes/TradeQueryGenerator.lua:1010 dropdown-option
msgid "Keep"
msgstr "保留"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Classes/TradeQueryGenerator.lua:1013 label
msgid "Rune Behaviour:"
msgstr "符文行為:"

#. Source: reviewed translation batch
#: src/Classes/TradeQueryGenerator.lua:1019 tooltip-text
msgid "Controls how anoints are used in the search.\n\nCopy Current: anoints are replaced with the current anoint when possible.\nUsually the best opinion as this ensures the anoint makes sense for your build.\n\nKeep: anoints will not be changed on items.\nBest used when you cannot add one yourself. Note that weights cannot be generated for anoints.\n\nRemove: anoints are completely ignored, and removed from items."
msgstr "控制搜尋中如何使用塗油。\n\n複製目前: 會在可能時以目前塗油替換。\n這通常是最佳選項，因為可確保塗油適合你的構築。\n\n保留: 不會變更物品上的塗油。\n當你無法自行加入塗油時最適合使用。請注意，塗油無法產生權重。\n\n移除: 完全忽略塗油，並從物品上移除。"

